'''Pickaxes''', often abbreviated to '''picks''', are [[melee]] [[weapons]] and [[Mining]] tools used to mine any type of [[Mining#Mineable items|ore or otherwise mineable item]], in addition to some types of blockages in [[Gielinor]]. Pickaxes can either be held in the [[inventory]] or wielded as a weapon with the requisite [[Attack]] level. While they are typically less effective in combat than most other weapons of the same level, this is useful when mining for profit, as one extra ore can be held.

Higher-level pickaxes grant more frequent opportunities to obtain an ore from a [[rock]], but have no effect upon the chance of successfully doing so.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1188758467399618560|date=28 October 2019|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/99025|archivedate=16 May 2020|quote=Your level affects the chance of getting ore each time the game rolls; your pickaxe affects how often that happens.}} Pickaxes cannot be made by players. They can be bought from shops such as [[Nurmof's Pickaxe Shop]], [[Yarsul's Prodigious Pickaxes]], [[Pickaxe-Is-Mine]], [[Toothy's Pickaxes]], and [[Gwyn's Mining Emporium]].

