==Uses==
===Achievement Diary===
*[[Varrock Diary#Easy|Varrock Diary (Easy)]]: Mine some [[Iron ore|iron]] in the [[south-east Varrock mine]].
*[[Wilderness Diary#Easy|Wilderness Diary (Easy)]]: Mine some [[Iron ore]] in the [[Wilderness]].

===Quests===
*[[Elemental Workshop I]]: 1 × any pickaxe to mine [[elemental rock]]
*[[Below Ice Mountain]]: 1 × any pickaxe to mine [[structural pillar]]s

